				<r3d:description language="eng">Project Data Sphere, LLC, operates a free digital library-laboratory where the research community can broadly share, integrate and analyze historical, de-identified, patient-level data from academic and industry cancer Phase II-III clinical trials.  These patient-level datasets are available through the Project Data Sphere platform to researchers affiliated with life science companies, hospitals and institutions, as well as independent researchers,  at no cost and without requiring a research proposal.</r3d:description>
